  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Looking for a spacious getaway with stunning Gulf views and unparalleled access to nature? Palm Sounds is a three-story townhouse with 3 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, offering a blend of comfort, convenience, and picturesque surroundings. Situated directly on a state park, this property boasts breathtaking Gulf-front views and is just a short stroll across the street to the nearest beach access. Whether you're planning a family vacation or a trip with friends, this property is perfectly designed to create lasting memories.<br><br>The main living area invites you to relax with plush sofas, a large TV for movie nights, and direct balcony access, a perfect spot for sipping your morning coffee while enjoying the Gulf breeze. The dining area comfortably seats 4, complemented by an adjacent eat-in kitchen with additional seating for 4. The fully equipped kitchen ensures easy meal preparation, featuring modern appliances such as a coffee maker, Keurig, toaster, blender, and refrigerator with an ice maker. A washer and dryer are included for added convenience, and a half bathroom is located on this level for quick access during your stay. Upstairs, the master bedroom offers a king bed with breathtaking Gulf views, while the queen bedroom provides a cozy space for restful nights.<br><br>Unique to Palm Sounds is its versatile third bedroom, located on the ground level with a separate key entry. This space includes its own living area with comfortable sofas, one of which converts into a queen-sized bed, a queen bedroom, a TV, a private bathroom, and a mini-fridge. Ideal for extended families or guests seeking privacy, this area ensures everyone can enjoy their own space while staying connected.<br><br>Outside, the backyard is a highlight, featuring a brand new private BBQ grill area with an outdoor dining table and chairs. Whether you're grilling fresh seafood or enjoying a sunset dinner, this space is perfect for gathering and making memories.<br><br>Another standout feature of this location is the wheelchair-accessible beach entry with no stairs, along with convenient beach bathrooms and seasonal lifeguards. Plus, major grocery stores offer delivery, making it easy to stock up on essentials without leaving the comfort of your stay.<br><br>Nearby Attractions:<br>When it comes to local attractions, Palm Sounds is perfectly located. You’re just minutes away from George's at Alys Beach, the Peddlers Pavilion, and Rosemary Downtown, where you’ll find The Pearl and Sugar Shack. For even more shopping and dining, head to 30Avenue, with places like Amigos, Amicis, and Idyll Proper, or visit Watersound Towncenter, where you’ll find Publix, Ambrosia, and Sweet Henriettas.<br><br>Inlet Beach Underpass:<br>This friendly pedestrian and bicycle underpass in Inlet Beach, Florida, offers a safe crossing over E. County Hwy 30A. It provides a safe way to cross E. County Hwy 30A, making it easy for everyone to get to nearby neighborhoods and beautiful beaches. This underpass is perfect for families and friends who enjoy biking, walking, or jogging together. Enjoy the great outdoors and the vibrant community that surrounds you!<br><br>Your stay at Palm Sounds comes with Xplorie’s best activities! Tee off at Emerald Bay or Regatta Bay, zip through Baytowne Adventure Zone, and sail on the Sea Blaster Dolphin Cruise. Enjoy Big Kahuna’s Water Park, Black Light Mini Golf, and scenic bike rides with complimentary rentals. Explore 30A with ease and adventure!<br><br>Additional Information:<br>* Dog Friendly: If bringing a pet, an additional non-refundable pet fee will be added to your booking. Please contact us if you are bringing a dog. A maximum of 2 dogs is allowed at a maximum of 30 lbs. Please see our rental policies for further details.<br>*Parking for 2 cars only.<br><br>A starter set of amenities is provided: The kitchen includes paper towels, a sponge, dish soap, dishwasher pods, kitchen wipes, trash liners, and laundry pods. Each bathroom has toilet paper, facial and bath soaps, body wash, shampoo, and conditioner. Towels include one body towel and washcloth per guest, plus two hand towels per bathroom.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
